{
  "info": {
    "name": "matchmaking",
    "description": "Complete matchmaking backend API — auth-service + matchmaking-api.\n\n## Services\n- **auth-service** (:8081) — session JWT issuance + JWKS\n- **matchmaking-api** (:8080) — HTTP/WebSocket gateway (tickets, history, WS push)\n\n## Start (order matters)\n```bash\nmvn -pl services/auth-service exec:java -Dexec.mainClass=com.victor.matchmaking.auth.AuthServiceApplication\nmvn -pl services/matchmaking-api exec:java -Dexec.mainClass=com.victor.matchmaking.api.MatchmakingApiApplication\nmvn -pl services/matchmaking-engine exec:java -Dexec.mainClass=com.victor.matchmaking.engine.MatchmakingEngineApplication\n```\n\n## Auth\nEvery matchmaking-api request except `/health` needs a Bearer token from `POST /v1/auth/login`.\n\n## WebSocket\nOpen `WS Connect`, then send frames: PING, MATCH_CONFIRM, MATCH_DECLINE. Incoming: PONG, MATCH_PENDING_CONFIRMATION, MATCH_CONFIRMED, MATCH_CANCELLED, ERROR.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "authBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenP1",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenP2",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "ticketId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "matchId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "nextCursor",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "auth-service",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/auth/login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('token', pm.response.json().token);",
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"playerId\": \"player-1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{authBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "description": "Issue a session token. In dev, login auto-provisions the player.\n\n**Expected:** 200 with `{ \"token\": \"...\", \"expiresIn\": 3600 }`.\n**Error:** missing/blank playerId → 400."
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /.well-known/jwks.json",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json",
              "host": [
                "{{authBaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                ".well-known",
                "jwks.json"
              ]
            }
          },
          "description": "Public keys for offline JWT validation. matchmaking-api fetches this on startup.\n\n**Expected:** 200 with `{ \"keys\": [ { \"kty\": \"RSA\", \"alg\": \"RS256\", \"kid\": ... } ] }`."
        }
      ]
    },
