        {
          "name": "websocket",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "WS Connect",
              "request": {
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "ws://localhost:8080/v1/ws?token={{token}}",
                  "protocol": "ws",
                  "host": [
                    "localhost"
                  ],
                  "port": "8080",
                  "path": [
                    "v1",
                    "ws"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{token}}"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "description": "Push notifications channel. Open the connection, then send frames.\n\n**Client→server:**\n- `{\"type\":\"PING\",\"payload\":{}}` → expect `PONG`\n- `{\"type\":\"MATCH_CONFIRM\",\"payload\":{\"matchId\":\"...\"}}` → confirm\n- `{\"type\":\"MATCH_DECLINE\",\"payload\":{\"matchId\":\"...\"}}` → decline\n\n**Server→client:** `PONG`, `MATCH_PENDING_CONFIRMATION`, `MATCH_CONFIRMED`, `MATCH_CANCELLED`, `ERROR`.\n\nThe matchmaking-engine must be running for pairing/confirmation."
            }
          ]
        },
